     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">My guess is that one of the packages you are using has an optional dependency upon the &quot;markdown&quot; package, and your code is triggering that code path.<div>We don&#39;t install optional packages, so if you need to make use of &quot;markdown&quot;, add a call to &quot;library(markdown)&quot; in your code and redeploy.</div></div>"
    ],
